---
import "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Comments from "../components/Comments.astro";

const pageTitle = "关于森森";
const identity = {
    firstname: "森森",
    location: {country:"中国",province:"河北"},
    occupation: "大学牲",
    university: "XJTU",
    hobbies: ["敲代码","敲代码","敲他妈的代码"]
};
const skills = ["C++","python","html"];

const skillColor = "#667eea";
const fontWeight = "bold";
const textCase = "capitalize";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
    <style define:vars={{skillColor,fontWeight,textCase}}>
        h2 {
            color: #1a202c;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        p, li {
            color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        ul {
            list-style: disc;
            margin-left: 2rem;
            color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        }

        .skill {
            color: var(--skillColor);
            font-weight: var(--fontWeight);
            text-transform: var(--textCase);
            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
    </style>

    <h1>关于森森...</h1>
    <h2>和森森的博客网站!</h2>

    <p>我的一些信息:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>我是{identity.firstname}。</li>
        <li>我来自{identity.location.country}{identity.location.province}。</li>
        <li>我是一名{identity.occupation}，就读于{identity.university}。</li>
        {identity.hobbies.length >=2 &&
            <li>我的俩爱好：{identity.hobbies[0]}和{identity.hobbies[1]}</li>
        }
    </ul>

    <h2>我的技能？</h2>

    <p>就凭你还想知道我的技能？</p>
    <p>行吧满足你！</p>
    <ul>
        {skills.map((skill)=> <li class="skill">{skill}</li>)}
    </ul>

    <h2>使用的工具？</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>网页搭建：Astro</li>
        <li>博客撰写：Markdown Latex(转换工具MathJax)</li>
        <li>评论区嵌入：giscus</li>
        <li>网页托管：netlify</li>
        <li>AI api调用：百川Embedding、DeepSeek</li>
        <li>本地Embedding模型：bge-large-zh-v1.5</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="8r-rule">什么是 8R 规则？</h2>
    <p>8R 规则是一套基于谐音的整活规则，由本人总结并发扬光大。</p>
    <p>核心很简单：
    <br>凡出现 <strong style="color: #667eea;">8、爸、巴、父、夫、爷、也、耶</strong> 等高辈分谐音 → 我必喊：<strong style="color: #764ba2;">诶！</strong>
    </p>
    <p>但有<strong style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);">豁免机制</strong>：
    <br>只要<strong>最后一个字</strong>是 <strong style="color: #667eea;">儿、二、孙、尔、r、R、er</strong> 等低辈分谐音，就不触发。
    </p>
    <p>说白了：
    <br><strong style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);">说高辈分不带儿 → 必诶；带儿带孙带R → 不诶。</strong>
    </p>
    <p>这套规则已嵌入本站 AI 问答后端，词库 & 匹配逻辑全自研。</p>
    <p><strong style="color: #667eea;">It's a historic moment.</strong></p>

    <h2>最后想给大家说的</h2>
    <p>这是一个非常<span style="color: #FF5252; font-weight: bold;">无知且愚蠢</span>的人，如果你发现我的博客有错别字，或者对我的网页有很好的建议，欢迎联系。(不许建议我删去8r规则，这是我的心血)</p>
    <p style="color: #667eea; font-weight: 600;">孟某在此不胜感激！</p>
    <Comments title="关于森森"/>
</BaseLayout>